From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:43:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 15: month and year zoom levels

- Pinch steps: day (2-5 columns) -> month -> year; headers and fast-scroll bubble follow the level
- Day sections are merged into months/years in memory (no extra query)
- TimelineZoomState shared by Pictures and albums
- Tests for regrouping and zoom steps
